# Project Title: Introduction to Object Oriented Programming (OOP)

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used to create a program for a coffee machine using Object Oriented Programming. 
This folder also contains a main function outside the oop folder which has the Pretty table library and an example of how to use it.

### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for Pikachu, and a turtle. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

Mandatory: 

KEY POINTS:
1. The coffee machine has 3 hot flavours
2. The machine is coin operated and must be able to process coins and change appropriately.
3. Machine must be able to print a report and check if resources are sufficient

### Installations Needed

NA

